{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"To factor means to rewrite an expression as a product. Let's try dividing the expression $18p-36$ by each factor.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $3$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}18p-36\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=3\\left(\\dfrac{18p-36}{3}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=3\\left(\\dfrac{18p}{3}-\\dfrac{36}{3}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=3(6p-12)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $18p-36$ is *not* equivalent to $3(9p-12)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $9$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}18p-36\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=9\\left(\\dfrac{18p-36}{9}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=9\\left(\\dfrac{18p}{9}-\\dfrac{36}{9}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=9(2p-4)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $18p-36$ is *not* equivalent to $9(2p-4p)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $2$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}18p-36\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{18p-36}{2}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{18p}{2}-\\dfrac{36}{2}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2(9p-18)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $18p-36$ is equivalent to $2(9p-18)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $18$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}18p-36\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=18\\left(\\dfrac{18p-36}{18}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=18\\left(\\dfrac{18p}{18}-\\dfrac{36}{18}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=18(p-2)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $18p-36$ is equivalent to $18(p-2)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $18p-36$:\n\n- $2(9p-18)$\n- $18(p-2)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Factor $18p-36$ to identify the equivalent expressions.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $27p-36$.","content":"$3(9p-12)$","correct":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $18p-36p$.","content":"$9(2p-4p)$","correct":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $18p-36$.","content":"$2(9p-18)$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $18p-36$.","content":"$18(p-2)$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":true,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
